The twins had been murdered. So who was responsible? Christopher Kahui and Kuru Kahui were born at the National Women's Hospital Auckland, New Zealand on the 20th of March 2006. The twins were later transferred to Middlemore Hospital. Their mother was Maxina King, 29 years old, and their father was Chris Kahui, 21 years old. They had one other child together already, Shane Kahui, who was 13 months of age at the

3
